Feature: Account Lockout Mechanism

  Scenario Outline: Five failed sign-ins lock an account for five minutes
    Given I am a security officer
    When I attempt to sign in with the wrong password "wrongpassword" (s) five times within fifteen minutes
    Then my account is locked for five minutes with TOO_MANY_ATTEMPTS
