  Scenario: Boundary - four failed attempts do not lock account
    Given I am a security officer
    When I attempt to sign in with the wrong password "wrongpassword" (s) four times within fifteen minutes
    Then my account is not locked

  Scenario: Boundary - six failed attempts lock account for five minutes
    Given I am a security officer
    When I attempt to sign in with the wrong password "wrongpassword" (s) six times within fifteen minutes
    Then my account is locked for five minutes with TOO_MANY_ATTEMPTS

